{"product_id":"the-mountain-of-adventure-adventure-series","title":"The Mountain of Adventure (Adventure Series)","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe fifth exciting installment in Enid Blyton's Adventure seriesSurely a peaceful holiday in the Welsh mountains will keep the children out of trouble. But the mystery of a rumbling mountain soon has them thirsty for more adventure. Philip, Dinah, Lucy-Ann, Jack, and Kiki the parrot are determined to explore the mountain and uncover its secret, but first they must escape from a pack of ravenous wolves and a mad genius who plans to rule the world.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 133 x 203\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Enid Blyton\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781447262794\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 304\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45807555281049,"sku":"17RB-4-9781447262794","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68f632eb362e6_The_Mountain_of_Adventure__Adventure_Series__Enid_Blyton.jpg?v=1760972564","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-mountain-of-adventure-adventure-series","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}